      "description": "wpm and acc on Fig 2, in the machine's face.",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-fig\"><div><dt>wpm</dt><dd>65</dd></div><div><dt>acc</dt><dd>93<span class=\"ds-u\">%</span></dd></div></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-fig{display:flex;gap:36px;margin:0;padding:24px;background:#131313}.ds-fig dt{font:400 12px/1 ui-monospace,\"SF Mono\",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a3a3a3;margin-bottom:8px}.ds-fig dd{margin:0;font:700 88px/.85 \"Courier Prime\",\"Courier New\",Courier,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#e6e6e6}.ds-u{font-size:.5em;letter-spacing:0;color:#a3a3a3}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stats Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "stat-value",
      "description": "Five values under a faint rule; the wrong-keys count is plate red.",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-stats\"><div><dt>raw</dt><dd>72</dd><dd class=\"ds-sub\">wpm of the final text</dd></div><div><dt>keys</dt><dd>694<span class=\"ds-sl\">/</span><span class=\"ds-w\">52</span></dd><dd class=\"ds-sub\">right / wrong</dd></div><div><dt>time</dt><dd>120s</dd><dd class=\"ds-sub\">time limit</dd></div></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin:0;padding:18px 24px 24px;background:#131313;border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a}.ds-stats dt{font:400 12px/1 ui-monospace,\"SF Mono\",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a3a3a3;margin-bottom:10px}.ds-stats dd{margin:0;font:700 26px/1.1 \"Courier Prime\",\"Courier New\",Courier,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#e6e6e6}.ds-stats .ds-sub{margin-top:6px;font:400 11px/1.3 ui-monospace,\"SF Mono\",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#a3a3a3}.ds-sl{margin:0 .12em;font-weight:400;color:#a3a3a3}.ds-w{color:#e5554c}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Weak Key Discs",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "keycap",
      "description": "Flat key-top discs in a 1px ring, misses over total under each.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-caps\"><li><span class=\"ds-cap\">i</span><span class=\"ds-n\">4/23</span></li><li><span class=\"ds-cap\">d</span><span class=\"ds-n\">2/12</span></li><li><span class=\"ds-cap ds-wide\">space</span><span class=\"ds-n\">1/16</span></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-caps{display:flex;gap:12px 14px;margin:0;padding:24px;list-style:none;background:#131313}.ds-caps li{display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:6px}.ds-cap{display:grid;place-items:center;min-width:34px;height:34px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:17px;background:#1b1b1b;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #6a6a6a;font:700 16px/1 \"Courier Prime\",\"Courier New\",Courier,monospace;color:#e6e6e6}.ds-wide{font-size:13px}.ds-n{font:400 11px/1 ui-monospace,\"SF Mono\",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#a3a3a3}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Words Left Wrong",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "missed-word",
      "description": "The word as typed in plate red over the expected word.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-words\"><li><span class=\"ds-t\">fozm</span><span class=\"ds-e\">form</span></li><li><span class=\"ds-t\">throuzh</span><span class=\"ds-e\">through</span></li><li class=\"ds-more\">+4 more</li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-words{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 22px;margin:0;padding:24px;list-style:none;background:#131313}.ds-words li{display:grid;gap:4px}.ds-t{font:700 17px/1 \"Courier Prime\",\"Courier New\",Courier,monospace;color:#e5554c}.ds-e,.ds-more{font:400 11px/1 ui-monospace,\"SF Mono\",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#a3a3a3}.ds-more{align-self:end}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Speed Chart",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "chart-tip",
      "description": "Wpm so far (strong, dotted), raw wpm (mid), error crosses on a red right axis, seconds ruler, hover tip in the band above the plot.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chart\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 180\" width=\"360\" height=\"180\"><line class=\"g\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"330\" y1=\"36\" y2=\"36\"/><line class=\"g\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"330\" y1=\"91\" y2=\"91\"/><text class=\"a\" x=\"34\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text class=\"a\" x=\"34\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"end\">50</text><text class=\"a\" x=\"34\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line class=\"r\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"330\" y1=\"146\" y2=\"146\"/><line class=\"e\" x1=\"330\" x2=\"330\" y1=\"36\" y2=\"146\"/><text class=\"a ae\" x=\"340\" y=\"24\">err</text><path class=\"raw\" d=\"M44,80 L101,60 L158,70 L216,52 L273,66 L330,58\"/><path class=\"wpm\" d=\"M44,80 L101,72 L158,70 L216,64 L273,64 L330,63\"/><path class=\"x\" d=\"M154.5,105.5 L161.5,112.5 M154.5,112.5 L161.5,105.5\"/><line class=\"gd\" x1=\"216\" x2=\"216\" y1=\"36\" y2=\"146\"/></svg><p class=\"ds-tip\">second 4: 75 wpm, raw 86</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chart{position:relative;padding:12px;background:#131313}.ds-chart svg{display:block}.g{stroke:#2a2a2a}.r,.gd{stroke:#6a6a6a}.gd{stroke-dasharray:2 3}.e{stroke:#e5554c}.a{fill:#a3a3a3;font:11px ui-monospace,\"SF Mono\",Menlo,Consolas,monospace}.ae{fill:#e5554c;letter-spacing:.08em}.raw,.wpm,.x{fill:none;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-linecap:round}.raw{stroke:#6a6a6a;stroke-width:1.25}.wpm{stroke:#e6e6e6;stroke-width:1.75}.x{stroke:#e5554c;stroke-width:1.5}.ds-tip{position:absolute;left:240px;top:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 10px;background:#131313;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #6a6a6a;font:11px/1.3 ui-monospace,\"SF Mono\",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#e6e6e6;white-space:nowrap}"
    }
